Hide Copilot UI elements and welcome page

This patch removes several UI elements related to GitHub Copilot and changes
the default startup behavior to avoid showing the welcome page:

1. Account button (bottom-left) - changes isAccountsActionVisible default to false
2. Chat view and auxiliary sidebar - prevents chat view registration
3. Copilot status bar icon (bottom-right) - removes ChatStatusBarEntry registration
4. Welcome page on startup - changes workbench.startupEditor default to 'none'

These changes are intended for code-server deployments that want a minimal
interface without Copilot features or onboarding prompts.

